    <briefdescription>
<para>Mock history compressor for deterministic compression benchmarking. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Simulates realistic compression behavior with configurable:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Compression latency (default 100ms, configurable)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Token reduction ratio (default 60%, configurable)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Semantic similarity score (default 0.92, always ≥0.85 gate) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
